<title>USA: Eli Lilly says Prozac pregnancy study questioned.</title>
<headline>Eli Lilly says Prozac pregnancy study questioned.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some mental health experts question the validity of a study in the October 3 issue of the New England Journal of Medicine on the use of Prozac by pregnant women, said Eli Lilly and Co in a statement.</p>
<p>The medical journal published a study that found Prozac, the most commonly used depression-fighting drug in the United States, may cause several minor abnormalities in a baby if the mother takes it during pregnancy.</p>
</text>
